I like the game so much, but theres a few things that are terrible;

First than nothing, hitboxes are kinda broken, you can be aiming at one specific thing and another random thing next to it will take damage, which is very bad specially if you are on a village, because hitting randoms villagers that run by will get all of them angry at you, and if this happens on the first days, when you have almost nothing but a pickaxe, youre basically dead. Ive spent almost 16 hours on this game, probably will play it even more because is fun, you have lots of things to do and the fact that it is a rogue like game means that there's endless possibilities on what your next seed could be, what will you obtain, fight, acquire etc...

Graphics are an 8 out of 10, but they can run on basically anything, gameplay is a 10 out of 10
